stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Fresh: fast check contradicts it
  Fresh --> Checking: one turn passes uncorrected
  Fresh --> Corrected: the call fixes it
  Checking --> Standing: confirmed, or the recheck still disagrees
  Checking --> Checking: the agent fails, so a direct recheck
  Checking --> Overruled: the agent finds it right
  Checking --> Undetermined: the agent cannot tell
  Standing --> Spoken: the gate opens at a gap
  Standing --> Corrected: the call fixes it
  Standing --> Parked: someone parks the resource
  Corrected --> [*]
  Overruled --> [*]
  Undetermined --> [*]
  Parked --> [*]
  Spoken --> [*]
